# Input

```vue
<template>
  <div>
    <span>before text</span> 
    text
  </div>
  <div>
    <span>before element</span> 

    <strong>after blank line</strong>
  </div>
  <svg>
    <defs /> 

    <g></g>
  </svg>
  <div>
    <span>before comment</span> 

    <!-- grouped comment -->
  </div>
</template>

<template><div><span>before text</span> 
text</div><div><span>before element</span> 

<strong>after blank line</strong></div><svg><defs /> 

<g></g></svg><div><span>before comment</span> 

<!-- grouped comment --></div></template>

```


# Formatted

```vue
<template>
	<div>
		<span>before text</span>
		text
	</div>
	<div>
		<span>before element</span>

		<strong>after blank line</strong>
	</div>
	<svg>
		<defs />

		<g></g>
	</svg>
	<div>
		<span>before comment</span>

		<!-- grouped comment -->
	</div>
</template>

<template>
	<div><span>before text</span> text</div>
	<div>
		<span>before element</span>

		<strong>after blank line</strong>
	</div>
	<svg>
		<defs />

		<g></g>
	</svg>
	<div>
		<span>before comment</span>

		<!-- grouped comment -->
	</div>
</template>

```
